WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.224
On your phone, open Quick update.

2
00:00:02.224 --> 00:00:05.619
Tap Add a question.

3
00:00:05.619 --> 00:00:10.492
Ask it the way a client would.

4
00:00:10.492 --> 00:00:15.420
Answer it simply.

5
00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.553
Not sure of the group?
Leave it, and move it later.

6
00:00:18.553 --> 00:00:22.992
Tap the button. It goes
at the end of its group.
